    "sections": {
        "description": "ST Currency Exchange is a modern, responsive, and professionally designed WordPress theme built specifically for currency exchange businesses, forex exchange offices, money transfer services, remittance companies, financial consultants, and foreign exchange agencies. The theme provides a clean and trustworthy design that helps businesses showcase exchange rates, services, branch locations, contact information, and customer support while creating credibility with potential clients. Whether you operate a local currency exchange office or an international money transfer business, ST Currency Exchange gives you everything needed to create a professional online presence without coding knowledge."
